  (text "GPS CARD rev B (all through-hole)  -  PIC18F26Q83 + MCP2562: reads a remote GPS puck (UART) and sends position / motion / time on CAN" (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 3 3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cbad3d76-fc31-58d7-a5a4-7433d1577d1e"))
  (text "Card for a DigiDash slot, 80 x 60 mm, standing on edge (docs/hardware/accessory_ports.md), any slot. CAN node 0x14 + (slot - 1), product 0x0005, IDs 0x222-0x226 (docs/hardware/gps_card.md). 5 V from the slot only; 3.3 V on board. Every part is through-hole, for hand assembly." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "842026d0-612a-5ce3-9ab8-1c483c2a4792"))
  (symbol (lib_id "Connector_Generic:Conn_02x15_Odd_Even") (at 45 55 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "f4da4ac4-ed1c-5c11-ae71-1041eb8d018e")
