  (text "MCU: PIC18F26Q83-I/SP (SPDIP-28, in a socket). Pin use (DS40002253 pin allocation and PPS tables; 28-pin PPS: UART1, UART2 and CAN on ports B and C only):\nRC6 (pin 17) U1TX by PPS, RC7 (pin 18) U1RX (its POR default): the puck.  RB4 (pin 25) U2TX, RB5 (pin 26) U2RX, both by PPS: debug serial (J4).\nRB2 (pin 23) CANTX by PPS, RB3 (pin 24) CANRX (its POR default).  RA1 (pin 3) ANA1: slot ID.  RC2 (pin 13): LED.\nRA7 / RA6 (pins 9 / 10): 16 MHz crystal, HS mode, 4x PLL = 64 MHz (RSTOSC = EXTOSC with 4x PLL, FEXTOSC = HS).\nConfig: JTAGEN off (JTAG shares RA0, RA5, RB3, RB5), LVP on (default) so any PICkit / Snap programs it at 3.3 V.\nICSP: MCLR (pin 1), ICSPCLK RB6 (pin 27), ICSPDAT RB7 (pin 28). No pull-ups or caps on RB6 / RB7, no cap on MCLR." (at 170 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "21882b00-a78d-5799-9816-c70ff0175caf"))
  (symbol (lib_id "GPSCard2:PIC18F26Q83-I_SP") (at 210 120 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "029bdf38-b6a5-58ca-b784-9268c20c78c1")
