  (text "GPS PUCK: J2, JST PH 4-pin side entry (S4B-PH-K), same pinout as the main board's J6: 1 puck power, 2 TX (out, to the puck's RX), 3 RX (in, from the puck's TX), 4 GND.\nPuck power: 3.3 V or 5 V by JP1, a 3-pin header with a shunt (1-2 = 3.3 V, 2-3 = 5 V), through a 0.25 A PTC. 100 R in series on TX and RX (no THT ESD array exists: the series resistors and the PIC's own clamps protect the lines)." (at 170 200 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d7eda657-eb7b-5537-b8fd-cebc4ac2fa3a"))
